# LSMS Staging (Contabo) — imejengwa 2026-10-03

Staging binafsi inayofanana na production (image zilezile), yenye data
iliyorejeshwa kutoka backup ya B2. Haigusi production: ina project, network,
volume na port zake yenyewe.

## Kanuni
- Amri ZOTE za staging: `cd ~/lsms-staging && docker compose -p lsms-staging ...`
- Usiendeshe `down`, `stop`, `rm`, `up`, `restart` ndani ya `~/lsms-deployment`.
- Staging haiwaki yenyewe baada ya reboot (`restart: "no"`).
  Kuiwasha tena: `cd ~/lsms-staging && docker compose -p lsms-staging up -d`

## Kilichopo
| Service | Image | Mem | Port |
|---|---|---|---|
| postgres | postgres:15 | 1g | hakuna |
| backend | chiefmaster/my-lsms-backend:2.2.58 | 1536m | hakuna |
| frontend (Flutter) | chiefmaster/lsms-frontend:2.2.53 | 128m | hakuna |
| frontend-v3 | chiefmaster/lsms-frontend-v3:3.0.1 | 128m | hakuna |
| nginx | nginx:1.31.2 | 128m | 127.0.0.1:8081 -> 80 tu |

Network: `lsms-staging-net`. Volume: `lsms-staging_pgdata`.
Container: `lsms-staging-<service>-1`.

## Jinsi ya kuingia
Kwenye kompyuta yako:

    ssh -L 8081:localhost:8081 contabo

Kisha fungua:
- V3 (Angular): http://localhost:8081/v3/
- Flutter:      http://localhost:8081/

Akaunti na nywila ni zilezile za production kama zilivyokuwa kwenye dump ya
2026-10-03 13:28. Token za production hazifanyi kazi staging (JWT_SECRET ni mpya).

## Jaribio la restore kutoka B2 (2026-10-03) — LIMEFAULU
- Dump: `lsms_20261003_1328.dump` (7,840,359 bytes), imepakuliwa kutoka
  `b2:elikom-lsms-backups/daily/`
- sha256 ya B2 = sha256 ya `~/backups/daily/` (6d131616...157d197c): SAWA
- `pg_restore --no-owner`: exit code 0, mistari ya stderr 0
- Jedwali: staging 76, production 76
- Jumla ya rows: staging 106,334, production 106,334; jedwali zenye tofauti: 0
- Flyway: migrations 90, ya juu V122; backend 2.2.58 haikuongeza yoyote
- `/tmp/staging-restore` imefutwa

## Tofauti na production
`.env` (mode 600) ni nakala ya production, isipokuwa:
- `JWT_SECRET` — thamani mpya (openssl rand -base64 64)
- `APP_SCHEDULERS_ENABLED=false` — imeongezwa (na kupitishwa kwa backend)
- `BACKEND_VERSION=2.2.58` — imeongezwa (production imeandika tag moja kwa moja)

`default.conf`: block ya `return 444` imeondolewa na `server_name` ni `_`.
Block ya `location ^~ /v3/` imebaki.

## Kilichozimwa
- IMEZIMWA kwa `APP_SCHEDULERS_ENABLED=false`:
  `MaterializedViewScheduler` (refresh ya materialized views) na
  `CapitalExpenditureScheduler` (matumizi ya kujirudia, GL, bajeti, depreciation,
  ripoti ya mwezi).
- HAZIWEZI kuzimwa kwa env kwenye 2.2.58 (hazina @ConditionalOnProperty):
  `DailySalesNotificationScheduler` (00:00) na `PasswordResetScheduler` (02:00).
  Zinaandika kwenye DB ya staging tu. Kama staging ikiwa hewani usiku wa manane,
  itaongeza notification ya muhtasari wa mauzo kwenye DB ya staging.
- Huduma za nje (SMS, email, webhook, API za nje): backend 2.2.58 HAINA yoyote
  (hakuna dependency wala HTTP/mail client kwenye code), kwa hiyo hakuna cha kuzima.
  Imethibitishwa: backend ya staging ina connection za postgres ya staging tu.
- Uthibitisho wa schedulers ni thamani ya env ndani ya container (`false`) na
  kutokuwepo kwa mistari ya scheduler kwenye log; class hizo haziandiki log
  wakati wa kuanza, kwa hiyo hakuna mstari wa "disabled".

## Scripts
- `./stock.sh <sehemu ya jina>` — READ-ONLY, DB ya STAGING tu. Inaonyesha id,
  jina, `current_stock`, is_active, is_deleted. Tumia kabla na baada ya kila
  jaribio (hasa kufuta sale).
- `./teardown.sh --dry-run` — inaonyesha itakachofuta, haifuti kitu.
- `./teardown.sh` — inaonyesha containers/volumes/networks, inakataa kama jina
  lolote halianzi na `lsms-staging`, inaomba uandike `yes`, kisha
  `docker compose -p lsms-staging down -v` (data ya staging inafutwa).

